--- tests/test_cap.c (first test of the file: a link error counts as red) ---

RED  make build/test_cap
     ld: undefined reference to `adf_fball_cap' (six call sites: cap_basic, cap_exact_untouched,
     cap_invariant_and_idempotent, cap_domain_on_nonpositive_C, cap_unsupported_on_local_input,
