GREEN ./build/test_cap (after the real adf_fball_sub_cap), first pass:
     18 tests, 825 checks, 1 failed check, 1 failed test: sub_cap_aliasing, at "x - x = the exact
     0". Test bug, not an implementation bug: this library's tight subtraction does not track the
     correlation of an operand with itself; adf_fball_sub(z, x, x) computes 0 + gcd(N, N) Zhat =
     0 + N Zhat, the same as any two independent balls with equal centre and radius, not the exact
     point 0. Fixed the test's expectation (0 + 8 Zhat capped at C = 6 is 0 + 2 Zhat).

GREEN ./build/test_cap (after the test fix)
     18 tests, 825 checks, 0 failed checks, 0 failed tests.

